  "pli-tv-kd4:13.1.48.1": "_Nānāsaṁvāsaka_ (and _samānasaṁvāsaka_) need to be carefully distinguished from _nānāsaṁvāsa_ (and _samānasaṁvāsa_). Only the former means “one belonging to a different Buddhist sect”. The latter means “belonging to a different community”, as decided by _sīmās_. ",
