  "pli-tv-kd4:14.4.1": "“A passed-on invitation that has expired”, _pārivāsikapavāraṇādānena_, seems to refer to an invitation that was conveyed for a different occasion. So long as the assembly is still seated, the occasion is regarded as the same. See the discussion to Bi Pc 81 in Appendix on Individual Bhikkhunī Rules in volume 3. ",
