  "pli-tv-kd4:16.16.4": "Vin-vn-ṭ 2777: _Sānuvādoti ettha anuvādo nāma codanā, saha anuvādena vattatīti sānuvādo_, “_Sānuvādo_: here accusing is called _anuvādo_. _Sānuvādo_ means he proceeds with an accusation.” ",
